<tr><td colspan="5"><table width="100%"><tr><td colspan="3" style="vertical-align:bottom;font-family:arial;font-size:13" align="left"><A HREF="https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264310"><u>Semantic View</u></A>&nbsp;(<A HREF="https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264310.json"><u>JSON</u></A>,&nbsp;<A HREF="https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264310.rdf"><u>RDF</u></A>,&nbsp;<A HREF="https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264310.ttl"><u>N3/Turtle</u></A>,&nbsp;<A HREF="https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300264310.nt"><u>N-Triples</u></A>)</td></tr><tr><TD COLSPAN=3 NOWRAP><SPAN CLASS=page><BR><B>ID: 300264310</B><BR><B>Page Link:</B> http://vocab.getty.edu/page/aat/300264310</SPAN><BR>&nbsp;</TD>
